        {
          "description": "A conjunctive weapon selector (PCGen's `TYPE=Martial.Ranged`) whose every tag the live `WeaponTableEntry` can answer directly -- a tier (`proficiency`) AND/OR a reach (`is_melee`/`is_ranged`). SD-36 Epic F1-3 (`epic-f-class-completion.md` §3.2/§3.3): today's converter joined a conjunction into one lossy word (`\"Light.Martial\"`); this is the list instead. A conjunct carrying a tag the table cannot answer (e.g. `Light`, `Thrown`) is never put here -- it becomes a [`ProfRef::WeaponSet`] instead, expanded at ingest.",
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "WeaponAllOf"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "WeaponAllOf": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
